{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A &quot;cohabitation life simulation&quot; where you live under the same roof as the heroine and interact freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lily serves as your maid and spends day and night with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage a tavern together, deepen your bond, and enjoy life in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The long war has ended, leaving knights and mercenaries without work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Living quietly in the tavern left by your grandfather, you one day take in a lone girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your carefree retirement comes to an end,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and a busy life of running the tavern alongside Lily begins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Life with Lily</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inside the tavern or bedroom, you can interact with the heroine through conversation and physical contact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can choose various actions, such as stroking her through touch commands or inviting her to sexual activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Tavern Management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather ingredients from city shops or the outskirts and cook original dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Setting up prepared menus and furnishings will affect the tavern's management and the player stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Intimacy Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through interaction commands and touch actions, you can freely engage in sexual activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you act, the more Lily will open up to new experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Lily\u2019s Dress-Up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can change Lily\u2019s hairstyle and outfit separately between workwear and nightwear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various parts such as bangs, back hair, hair accessories, outfit, and underwear can be collected.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3767880?t=1749783271","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767880/6aebfd1fb8f704ab1ef9589cd175feb23c9b9973/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749783271","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767880/a1b377cbc3649518007022c08578fc4cc2cfb3e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749783271","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767880/a1b377cbc3649518007022c08578fc4cc2cfb3e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749783271","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"- A naughty live-in with a maid\r\n- Sexual activity with a close female\r\n- Contains extreme sexual content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A &quot;cohabitation life simulation&quot; where you live under the same roof as the heroine and interact freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lily serves as your maid and spends day and night with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage a tavern together, deepen your bond, and enjoy life in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The long war has ended, leaving knights and mercenaries without work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Living quietly in the tavern left by your grandfather, you one day take in a lone girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your carefree retirement comes to an end,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and a busy life of running the tavern alongside Lily begins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Life with Lily</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inside the tavern or bedroom, you can interact with the heroine through conversation and physical contact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can choose various actions, such as stroking her through touch commands or inviting her to sexual activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Tavern Management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather ingredients from city shops or the outskirts and cook original dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Setting up prepared menus and furnishings will affect the tavern's management and the player stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Intimacy Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through interaction commands and touch actions, you can freely engage in sexual activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you act, the more Lily will open up to new experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 Lily\u2019s Dress-Up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can change Lily\u2019s hairstyle and outfit separately between workwear and nightwear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various parts such as bangs, back hair, hair accessories, outfit, and underwear can be collected.</p>","developers":["Parthia Studio LLC"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3561400","name":"Fallen / Brand New World"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767880/7af5093e1084a64bd69718c1b0514434aaf46ac2/header.jpg?t=1749783271","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":false,"id":257152248,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152248/mo